How to sort a List by order of an enum? 

Enum:


     public enum ComponentType {
    INSTRUCTION, ACTION, SERVICE, DOMAIN, INTEGRATION, OTHER, CONTEXT;
    }


Class A :


     public class A
    {
    String name;
    ComponentType c;
