Repeatedly adding a single instance of an object to a collection, but having the collection store multiple instances 

I am trying to add objects of a class to a vector. But on adding the second object the first objects gets replaced with the second object. 

Here is my code:


     Vector res = new Vector();
    Item item = new Item();
    item.Name = "maclean";
    item.Des = "abcd";
    item.Price = "RS 350";
    item.image = "c.gif";
